WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:08.180
Our Community Spaces and Places - Ō Tātou
Wāhi

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.920
Our district is growing, so there are more people wanting to use our community spaces and places.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:25.240
Right now, the Council provides 34 community
buildings, including swimming pools, libraries,

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.880
town halls and service centres.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.580
The council also provides about 1,000 hectares of

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.540
extensive park and reserve space

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.320
including neighbourhood parks,  sports parks,

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.220
public gardens, and cultural
heritage sites.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:46.080
These are really important in supporting community
health and wellbeing,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.120
and in attracting residents, businesses and events to our district.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:57.120
We need to plan well for the future
and think about what community facilities

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.280
and open spaces we need for our growing population.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:09.080
Our District, Our Future - Waimakariri 2048 aims to:

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:32.320
So what do you think?

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:38.680
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:43.580
waimakariri.govt.nz

